{
  "name": "Resonance Core",
  "icon": "cyberfarm:resonance_core",
  "category": "cyberfarm:energy_storage",
  "sortnum": 2,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "cyberfarm:resonance_core"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "A buildable battery: a polyhedral crystal floats over the pedestal, columns of $(l)Stabilizer Pylons$() on its sides send out drones that circle it and hold it steady with waves, and a shell of $(l)Resonance Cells$() around the crystal makes it bigger, tier by tier."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "$(li)$(l)1$(): none, 1,000,000 FE, 1, 2, 3-8, 16,000 FE/t$(br)$(li)$(l)2$(): 3x3x3 (26 cells), 32,000,000 FE, 2, 3, 4-10, 128,000 FE/t$(br)$(li)$(l)3$(): 5x5x5 (98 cells), 256,000,000 FE, 3, 4, 5-12, 512,000 FE/t$(br)$(li)$(l)4$(): 7x7x7 (218 cells), 2,000,000,000 FE, 4, 5, 6-14, 2,000,000 FE/t",
      "title": "Tiers"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "$(li)Place the $(l)Resonance Core$() (the pedestal). Alone it is tier 1.$(br)$(li)Build a shell of $(l:energy_storage/resonance_cell)Resonance Cells$(/l) around the space above it for tiers 2-4.$(br)$(li)Put up the columns of $(l:energy_storage/stabilizer_pylon)Stabilizer Pylons$(/l) the tier asks for, on its sides.",
      "title": "Building it"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "The $(l:basics/multiblock_projector)Multiblock Projector$(/l) shows every tier, pylons included: sneak + right-click to pick it, then click the pedestal."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Every tier at its smallest, with the pylons at their closest. Drag to turn the scene.$(br2)$(l)Tier 1$()$(br2)The core alone: one pylon column, two blocks tall, at least three blocks away.",
      "title": "What each tier looks like"
    },
