    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Right-click $(l)any part$() of the core to open it: the pedestal, any cell of the shell (finished or not) or any block of a pylon column lined up with it. The screen shows:$(br)$(li)its $(l)tier and shell$(), and whether it is $(l)Online$() or $(l)Unstable$();",
